# Play test of Tangaroa Remade (CIPlay tangaroa_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the floating
# harbour's deck (1.96 m) on its ring pontoon east of the island, the harbour front (2.2 m) with the pump house at its
# west end, the road up to the square (12.5 m), the old statue on the sea floor north of the harbour (10 m down).
island Tangaroa Remade
expect step 0
expect title The Lights of Tangaroa

# Onto the floating harbour's deck: the council's notice at the pier's end
at 60 -4
zone harbour
expect step 0
read Council notice
expect step 1

# The harbour master's key card: into his office (its door faces the pier), his locker in the corner
walk 62 2 to 70 2 to 73 2 to 76 2 to 75.6 4.2 h=2
reach Harbour master's locker
open Harbour master's locker
expect story keycard 1

# The founder's key card: down from the north ladder to his toppled statue on the sea floor (7 m), his strongbox by it
at 53 12 h=-5
open Founder's strongbox
expect story keycard 2
expect step 2

# The harbour front: into the pump house - its rats - and the generator's part in its locker
walk 50 -4 to 40 -4 to 30 -4 to 25.5 -1 to 21 -1 h=2.2
zone pumphouse
kill Tangaroa rat
expect step 3
walk 22.5 -1 to 20 1.2 h=2.2 below=4
reach Pump house locker
open Pump house locker
expect story genpart 1
expect step 4

# Up the road to the square; the caretaker's flat in the apartment block - its roaches - and his locker
walk 25 -1 to 27 2.5 to 27.5 6 to 26.5 8 to 19.7 10 to 12.9 12 to 6.1 14 to -2 14 h=12.5
walk -2 14 to -3.5 16 to -3.5 19.5 to -5.5 20.5 h=12.5
zone flat
kill Roach
walk -3.5 16 to -3.5 19.5 to -5.5 20.5 h=12.5
reach Caretaker's locker
open Caretaker's locker
expect story keycard 3
expect step 5

# The generator by the council office: its part fitted, the lamps come on and the office's shutter rolls aside
walk -3.5 16 to -6 4 to -9 1.5 h=12.5
# (the council office's shutter shut while the city has no power)
walk -11 8 to -15.2 8 blocked h=12.5
use generator
expect message coughs and runs
expect shown citylights
expect story genpart 0
wait 3
walk -9 1.5 to -12 8 to -15.2 8 to -15.4 11 to -17.5 11.2 h=12.5
zone council
walk -15.2 8 to -15.4 11 to -17.5 11.2 h=12.5 below=15
reach Council's vault
open Council's vault
wait 5
expect item Blueprint_WaterTank 1
expect item Blueprint_Storage_Large 1
expect done
